@startuml
|Guest / Patient|
start
:Request RESCHEDULE OTP;
:Verify OTP;
:Choose proposed new slot;
|System|
:Validate grant and proposed slot;
:Create PendingReview request;
note right: Old appointment keeps its slot; proposed slot is not reserved yet.
|Receptionist|
:Review request;
if (Approve?) then (yes)
 |System|
 :Recheck new slot in transaction;
 if (Slot available?) then (yes)
  :Update appointment and history;
  :Mark request Approved;
  :Commit;
  stop
 else (no)
  :Keep old appointment unchanged;
  :Reject/expire request with reason;
  stop
 endif
else (no)
 |System|
 :Mark request Rejected;
 :Keep old appointment unchanged;
 stop
endif
@enduml
